# Exit this page

Provide a rapid departure route only when research identifies a risk from viewing sensitive content.

## When to use

Consider this pattern for sensitive support content where being observed could place someone at risk. It is not a general close button, a device emergency stop or a replacement for sign-out. A household control dashboard does not need this component merely because it contains personal information.

The examples below demonstrate visual placement and keyboard discovery only. They deliberately use local, clearly labelled destinations. They are not a production safety mechanism.

